        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Nayarit, Mexico\n- Waterways: The Mololoa River\n- Infrastructure: a dam completed in 2012\n- People: Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa\n- Roles: President of Mexico\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa served as President of Mexico from 2006 to 2012.\n- A dam on one of Nayarit's largest waterways was completed in 2012.\n- The dam was inaugurated by Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa.\n- The waterway is one of the biggest in Nayarit, Mexico, along with the Mololoa River.",
